      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the character from <Picture 1>. Only her identity is used: face, hairstyle, hair color, eye color, outfit, accessories, colors, and the clean full-color anime art style of <Picture 1>. The pose, framing, camera, and background of <Picture 1> are not used.\n<Picture 2> is the composition anchor for [Shot 1]: a manga panel that defines the camera angle, framing, the character's body pose, limb positions, hand positions, head direction, and placement in the frame. Its monochrome manga rendering, screentone, panel border, speech balloons, and text are not used.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] One still image of <Subject 1> posed and framed exactly like the character in <Picture 2>, rendered in full color in the art style of <Picture 1> on a plain simple background. The camera is locked and nothing moves.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): partially_preserved - the face, hair, eyes, outfit, colors, and art style of <Picture 1> are retained; its standing pose, framing, and camera are discarded and replaced by those of <Picture 2>.\n<Picture 2> (composition anchor for [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the camera angle, framing, body pose, limb and hand positions, head direction, and placement in the frame are reproduced; its monochrome rendering, screentone, borders, balloons, and text are not.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target is one finished full-color anime illustration, not a collage, split screen, or sequence.\n[Shot 1] A static shot whose composition is taken from <Picture 2>: the same camera angle, the same framing, and the character in the same place and at the same size in the frame as in <Picture 2>. <Subject 1> holds exactly the pose of the character in <Picture 2>, with the same body orientation, the same limb and hand positions, and the same head direction, while keeping her own face, hair, eyes, and outfit from <Picture 1>. She is drawn in the clean full-color anime style of <Picture 1>. The background is plain and simple with no text. Nothing moves for the whole shot.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nN/A\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
        1344,
        768,
        "recommended | 5 frames",
        0.4,
        "crop_center",
        "max_identity_2048",
        false
      ],
